================================================================================
What is NOT in here
================================================================================

No third-party reverb source code was copied into this project. The DSP was
implemented from published technique (feedback delay networks, Schroeder
allpass diffusion, Jot's attenuation-filter decay law) rather than adapted from
existing implementations. In particular no code was taken from CloudSeed,
CloudReverb, Dragonfly Reverb or MVerb, all of which are GPL-3 licensed.
